<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<Project Type="Project" LVVersion="20008000">
	<Property Name="CCSymbols" Type="Str"></Property>
	<Property Name="NI.LV.All.SourceOnly" Type="Bool">false</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Project.Description" Type="Str">Project to manage the quench protection of the NHMFL Series Connected Hybrid.
Total project consists of
FPGA code for 2 systems, primary and secondary protection
   Data from NHMFL designed fiber optic remote digitizers
   Protection detection algorithms for opening DC Breakers
    Recording data and transmitting to RT system
RT system to accumulate data from FPGA and send to remote clients over custom TCP/IP interface

Author: Scott Hannahs &lt;sth@magnet.fsu.edu&gt;
Copyright 2018 Florida State University, All rights reserved.
</Property>
